      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回到训练员室，打开电视，\n正巧在播放一档以创世驹为焦点的\n情报节目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f6bd77a18d590c5c38df270b31accf51c7a38ab2f4775712bc55abbd41ad3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
